<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <!-- ROT_FLORA_FAUNA_VERDICTS_1 — owner ruling 2026-09-19, applied provisionally
       (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/rot_flora_fauna_names.md /
       design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/rot_regen_briefs.json). Renames + resizes 19 donor AB_/AA_ defs
       (Alpha Biomes' Plants_MycoticJungle.xml, Alpha Animals' Races_*.xml) to
       the Rot's own campaign names and ruled mature widths.

       ⛔ NO MayRequire on an Operation — inert, and already the standing lesson
       in this file's own sibling PlantTolerances_Ashkarr.xml. Each def's block
       below is gated by PatchOperationConditional on the ThingDef's own xpath:
       if the donor mod is absent the outer Conditional's xpath simply does not
       match and the whole block no-ops — no MayRequire needed, no error logged,
       and no dependency on knowing the donor's exact ModContentPack.Name (which
       PatchOperationFindMod matches against, not packageId).

       Sizes: flora <plant><visualSizeRange> MAX set to the ruled width, MIN
       scaled to keep the def's own existing min:max ratio. Fauna: the adult
       PawnKindDef life stage (the 3rd <li> under <lifeStages>, matching
       lifeStageAges' baby/juvenile/adult order) bodyGraphicData/drawSize set
       to the ruled width; dessicatedBodyGraphicData left untouched (out of
       ruling scope). bodySize/combat stats are NOT touched by this file.

       AA_Agaripod and the skerrith are "keep + rename" (owner's own
       decision) — name only, no size, no art job; the skerrith (RM_Skerrith) is owned
       directly in Defs/Fauna (ROT_RM_CAST_MIGRATION_1), not here. -->

  <!-- ============== AB_AgaricusDomeCap -> skarrow dome (7 wide) ============== -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="AB_AgaricusDomeCap"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="AB_AgaricusDomeCap"]/label</xpath>
          <value><label>skarrow dome</label></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="AB_AgaricusDomeCap"]/description</xpath>
          <value><description>A squat, swollen dome of a mushroom as wide as a hut, its skin blotched in the yellows and bruise-purples that every other living thing reads as a warning. People read it as an invitation. Under the skin lies a pale psychotropic flesh, cut away a sliver at a time: one sliver opens the mind, two take it somewhere it does not come back from easily. It grows slowly, and each dome gives up very little.</description></value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="AB_AgaricusDomeCap"]/plant/visualSizeRange</xpath>
          <value><visualSizeRange>5.25~7</visualSizeRange></value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

